{"file": "末世度假酒店-第24集.mp4", "ep": 24, "duration": 52.6, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.92, "text": "女老板不是说"}, {"start": 0.92, "end": 1.96, "text": "卫生间里有水吗"}, {"start": 1.96, "end": 2.59, "text": "走"}, {"start": 2.59, "end": 3.47, "text": "咱们先去洗手"}, {"start": 3.47, "end": 4.95, "text": "然后再干干净净地吃饭"}, {"start": 4.95, "end": 9.22, "text": "人先办的生活"}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 10.46, "text": "如果你喜欢"}, {"start": 10.46, "end": 11.66, "text": "我们就在这里住下去"}, {"start": 11.66, "end": 12.66, "text": "这宾馆能开多久"}, {"start": 12.66, "end": 13.66, "text": "我们就住多久"}, {"start": 13.66, "end": 14.58, "text": "我很喜欢"}, {"start": 14.58, "end": 15.02, "text": "雷哥"}, {"start": 15.02, "end": 15.78, "text": "如果可以的话"}, {"start": 15.78, "end": 16.78, "text": "我还想生个宝宝"}, {"start": 16.78, "end": 17.38, "text": "宝宝"}, {"start": 17.38, "end": 17.98, "text": "我也想"}, {"start": 17.98, "end": 19.29, "text": "可是"}, {"start": 19.29, "end": 19.81, "text": "姐姐"}, {"start": 19.81, "end": 20.53, "text": "是我"}, {"start": 22.3, "end": 22.9, "text": "姐姐"}, {"start": 22.9, "end": 24.92, "text": "我来了"}, {"start": 24.92, "end": 26.16, "text": "这房间"}, {"start": 26.16, "end": 27.24, "text": "居然这么好"}, {"start": 27.24, "end": 27.92, "text": "别愣着了"}, {"start": 27.92, "end": 28.68, "text": "你快去洗洗"}, {"start": 28.68, "end": 29.88, "text": "用热水好好泡一泡"}, {"start": 29.88, "end": 31.6, "text": "只要能攀上刚刚那个大佬"}, {"start": 31.6, "end": 36.78, "text": "我甚至能住上更好的"}, {"start": 36.78, "end": 37.82, "text": "我连一块发霉的面包"}, {"start": 37.82, "end": 38.62, "text": "都吃不上"}, {"start": 38.66, "end": 40.42, "text": "这个女老板居然可以吃蛋糕"}, {"start": 40.42, "end": 41.38, "text": "真不公平"}, {"start": 43.98, "end": 44.58, "text": "熊熊"}, {"start": 44.58, "end": 45.74, "text": "我要去睡觉了"}, {"start": 45.74, "end": 46.9, "text": "辛苦你继续开门"}, {"start": 46.9, "end": 47.5, "text": "好的"}, {"start": 47.5, "end": 48.14, "text": "主人"}]}